WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:07.960
. There is a very notable double standard
that is taking place, as we predicted, between

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:12.309
the Donald Trump sexual assault allegations
and what's going on with Andrew Cuomo.

00:00:12.309 --> 00:00:18.340
Now, I want to remind everybody I don't care
about political party.

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:22.980
When it was Anthony Weiner, I said, look at
what this guy this guy is accused of terrible

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:23.980
things.

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:25.470
I have nothing to say in defense of him.

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:28.470
It's a shame in that he had some good political
ideas.

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:32.180
But how am I going to defend this guy with
Al Franken?

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:34.070
I thought the resignation happened too soon.

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:37.790
In retrospect, that definitely happened too
soon and it happened too soon, in part because

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:41.430
Democrats too quickly started saying he should
resign.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:46.930
What you know what, Al Franken, the crass
joke Al Franken was involved in was not good.

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:51.600
But compared to the things that that we've
seen since with Trump and others, it seems

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:56.930
relatively milquetoast without dismissing
anyone's experience of what happened with

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:58.100
Al Franken.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:00:59.740
But I had no interest.

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:01.500
I don't care about party.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:05.700
And much like with the Andrew Cuomo thing,
it's the same thing people have been writing,

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:07.939
saying, David, why won't you cover the Andrew
Cuomo scandals?

00:01:07.939 --> 00:01:09.700
I've covered every aspect of it.

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:11.579
I've covered the nursing home piece.

00:01:11.579 --> 00:01:14.189
I've covered the sexual assault piece.

00:01:14.189 --> 00:01:16.270
I've covered every single aspect of it.

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:17.950
And I don't care that he's a Democrat.

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:20.009
Let the cards fall where they may.

00:01:20.009 --> 00:01:26.569
I am not impressed with politicians in terms
of personality, cult, of personality and define

00:01:26.569 --> 00:01:28.420
what I don't I don't care about Andrew Cuomo.

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.289
If he did stuff wrong, then there should be
consequences.

00:01:31.289 --> 00:01:39.609
But it is incredibly brazen to now see so
many on the right, including Don Jr. himself,

00:01:39.609 --> 00:01:46.149
who's appearing on a nighttime right wing
media several times a week to talk about accusers

00:01:46.149 --> 00:01:47.850
of Andrew Cuomo.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:54.929
These same people, including, of course, Don
Jr., were saying nothing when Trump was accused

00:01:54.929 --> 00:01:58.279
by a dozen women and then a second dozen.

00:01:58.279 --> 00:01:59.909
And then what's the total number?

00:01:59.909 --> 00:02:01.009
Forty, forty six.

00:02:01.009 --> 00:02:02.009
Forty eight.

00:02:02.009 --> 00:02:03.569
Fifty women or something like that.

00:02:03.569 --> 00:02:10.030
Max Boot, who is not someone who I go to for
political analysis, actually has a pretty

00:02:10.030 --> 00:02:15.760
good piece about this in The Washington Post
called The Andrew Cuomo Scandal Highlights

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:18.210
Republicans appalling double standard.

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:27.200
And he points out that the calls for Andrew
Cuomo to resign from people who said nothing

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:31.020
about the allegations against Donald Trump
or said that they were not credible and shouldn't

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:34.140
be believed and they should be ignored is
crazy.

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:37.550
And again, Max Boot points out Democrats.

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:46.250
Aren't giving Andrew Cuomo a free pass, The
New York Times was integral in unveiling the

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:49.990
sexual harassment scandal related to Andrew
Cuomo.

00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:53.440
This is The New York Times that Trump and
other Republicans have been saying for years

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:58.150
is some kind of far left, a protector of all
Democrats.

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:02.050
And you you again see the huge double standard
is the double standard.

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:07.870
I've been pointing out for a long time what
Democrats were defending Anthony Weiner.

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:14.000
What Democrats were, if anything, the criticism
of Democrats is in order to show how they

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:19.060
are going to go after whoever is accused very
quickly, sometimes they go too far.

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:23.540
And arguably, things went too far in the early
calls for Al Franken resignation, which took

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:24.540
place.

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:27.960
Now, I know a lot of people are going to write
in and say, what about Tara Reid, the woman

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:36.230
who who accused Joe Biden that received a
ton of coverage and it started to fall apart

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:39.680
and eventually the story went away?

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:43.300
I don't I know that there are people who are
not going to like that characterization and

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:46.600
are going to say, no, no, no, it went away
because it was suppressed.

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:48.810
That's not what I believe took place at all.

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:51.580
I think it got plenty of coverage, in fact.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:55.319
So I say investigate everyone, get whoever
out.

00:03:55.319 --> 00:03:58.840
I don't care about political party.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:04.990
But what we are continuing to see is exactly
the type of hypocrisy on this issue, you know,

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:07.600
that that we've seen from the right for a
long time.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:10.180
You could you could argue it goes all the
way back to Bill Clinton.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:12.010
You could argue it goes back even further
than that.

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:14.450
I mean, listen, we were talking about Newt
Gingrich earlier.

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:21.970
Newt Gingrich's past when it comes to relationships
is not exactly what the evangelical right

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:25.020
claims that they support or want to get behind.

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:27.330
So this this has decades of history behind
it.

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:30.300
And the hypocrisy is is stunning.

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:31.300
Let me know what you think.

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:37.100
If I'm missing something in this where I misunderstood,
I am seeing hypocrisy where there is none

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:38.410
or whatever.

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:40.350
I certainly want to hear from you.

